  <name>MultiPak</name>
  <icon type="stock">io.github.goulielmos_linux.multipak</icon>
  <summary>Install different package formats and manage your applications</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="pt_BR">Instale diferentes formatos de pacotes e gerencie seus aplicativos</summary>
  <description>
    <p>MultiPak makes installing different package formats on Linux easier and more consistent, especially on atomic distributions. It brings RPM, DEB, compiled Arch Linux packages and AppImages together in a single graphical workflow, reducing the need to learn a separate installation process for each format.</p>
  </description>
